any woman to misunderstand.

292
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,640
I didn't want her to think

293
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,880
I was marrying her out of real love

294
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,280
when it was just a ritual.

295
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,240
I didn't want to hurt anyone.

296
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:28,000
So I decided to marry my younger brother,

297
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:30,480
because we both understood clearly that...

298
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:33,160
there was nothing serious between us.

299
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,120
Nothing serious.

300
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:44,280
What the hell kind of answer was that?

301
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,320
So this marriage

302
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,840
had no love involved at all?

303
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:02,280
That's right.

304
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,440
None.

305
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,080
And in the future,

306
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,320
do you have plans to get married for real?

307
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,920
If I meet the right person,

308
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:31,320
at the right time,

309
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,360
I'd be ready to marry.

310
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:39,440
So our ladies still have hope then?

311
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:42,600
Yes.

312
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,120
Nont,

313
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,000
I think

314
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:49,840
there's some reason

315
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,720
the boss answered like that.

316
00:17:52,560 --> 00:17:54,000
Just stay calm, okay?

317
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:00,400
"If I meet the right person,

318
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:02,880
when the time is right,

319
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,440
I'd be ready to marry."

320
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,160
Then what am I, Sharp?

321
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,760
What have I been waiting for?

322
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:34,480
Well done, Kit.

323
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,680
You handled that problem really well.

324
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,800
I'll tell the investors that

325
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,320
this matter is closed,

326
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:41,760
all problems are cleared.

327
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,160
We're going to become the partner

328
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,360
that takes a Thai company

329
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:48,560
to compete with
the tech powerhouse countries.

330
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,560
I'll wait out front

331
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,880
there are reporters lined up
waiting to interview us.

332
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,960
Nont, hear me out.

333
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:15,280
There's nothing to hear.

334
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:17,880
I'm sorry.

335
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:19,840
Sorry.

336
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,520
Sorry for what?

337
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,240
For saying there was
nothing serious between us'?

338
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,160
Or for saying

339
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:27,040
"if I meet the right person,
I'd be ready to marry"?

340
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:28,040
Nont.

341
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:29,400
Let me ask you seriously, Kit.

342
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:32,800
You said there was nothing serious between us,

343
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:34,880
do you actually mean that?

344
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,280
It's not like that.

345
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,520
Then what is it like?

346
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:39,320
It's a business matter, Nont.

347
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:40,800
I had no choice.

348
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:42,080
You had no choice.

349
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:44,600
Easy to say!

350
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:46,760
If I told the truth,

351
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:48,120
the company might collapse.

352
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,880
The company collapses.

353
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:51,280
The company collapses.

354
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,840
But what about me, Kit?

355
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,000
Aren't you afraid of me collapsing?

356
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:57,960
Nont.

357
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,200
Put the gloves on and come at me.

358
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:04,440
Put the gloves on and come at me

359
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,560
or you can run away like you always do.

360
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,240
Go on!

361
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:25,800
No rules.

362
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:27,480
No running.

363
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:28,520
No lying.

364
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:30,120
Begin.

365
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:33,160
What was all of it?

366
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,080
You said you felt something for me!

367
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:38,760
But you can't even bring yourself
to tell anyone!

368
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:41,400
10 years, Kit.

369
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:45,160
I've been waiting for you
to be ready for 10 years.

370
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,640
I've waited for you for 10 years.

371
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:48,720
I know!

372
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,160
You know and you still did this?

373
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,200
Because I'm scared!

374
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:53,480
I'm scared of everything!

375
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:55,200
Scared of what other people will think.

376
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,760
Scared the company will fall apart.

377
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,120
Scared that if I accept it,

378
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,400
everyone will change.

379
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,000
And what about me?

380
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:02,040
Huh?

381
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:03,360
And what about me?

382
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:05,640
You chose everything else!

383
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:06,920
You chose the company!

384
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:08,360
You chose the money!

385
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,160
I didn't choose!

386
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:11,760
I don't know what to choose.

387
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:13,840
I've never had to choose
something like this!

388
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:14,920
You already chose!

389
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:16,880
You already chose on that show.

390
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:18,400
You chose everything except me!

391
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:20,600
Can't even bring yourself to

392
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,760
tell anyone who I am to you.

393
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:23,520
So what do you want me to wait for?

394
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:26,080
Huh?

395
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:32,520
But I can't wait anymore, Kit.

396
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:40,640
I need someone who will stand beside me.

397
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:43,560
Not someone who hides me away!

398
00:22:50,280 --> 00:22:52,080
Nont, give me some time.

399
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:54,560
You've been asking for time all along.

400
00:22:55,560 --> 00:22:57,440
My time has run out too!

401
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,920
Kit, do you know...

402
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,840
when I started loving you?

403
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,320
That day before the school term started.

404
00:23:16,720 --> 00:23:18,000
You told me yourself,

405
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:20,040
that even if I had no one,

406
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,320
I still had you.

407
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:28,040
I was 14...

408
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,200
That's 10 years, Kit.

409
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:01,360
I love you...

410
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:08,800
I truly love you.

411
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:15,760
But I can't wait anymore, Kit.

412
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,040
I'm done.

413
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,280
Coming down now.

414
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:51,240
Mama Wan is here to pick me up.

415
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:37,240
Take care of yourself, Kit.

416
00:26:11,360 --> 00:26:12,840
I used to think

417
00:26:13,760 --> 00:26:14,760
that one day

418
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:17,200
I would be someone that

419
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:18,680
you truly wanted in your life.

420
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:22,000
But today I know...

421
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:25,480
that it will never be possible.

422
00:27:02,080 --> 00:27:03,120
So how does it feel,

423
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,440
first day back at work?

424
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:07,120
Got both a holiday and a new position.

425
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:08,800
How do I look?

426
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:11,040
Do I look okay now?

427
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:14,080
Do I suit the position of
Mr. Roch's secretary?

428
00:27:18,080 --> 00:27:19,200
Stunning.

429
00:27:22,760 --> 00:27:24,000
You're always stunning too.

430
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:26,480
Anyway, are you free at lunch?

431
00:27:26,520 --> 00:27:27,400
Let's eat together.

432
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:28,400
Sure,

433
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:29,720
I'm very free!

434
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,400
How is that possible

435
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:33,720
how can a CEO's assistant like you

436
00:27:34,040 --> 00:27:35,400
be that free?

437
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,320
How could I not be free...

438
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:41,360
the CEO hasn't come into the office
since what happened between you two.

439
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:45,920
I was going to call

440
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:47,840
and ask you what's wrong with him.

441
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:49,720
But I was afraid you'd bite my head off.

442
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:53,040
I...

443
00:27:53,560 --> 00:27:55,080
haven't talked to him at all either.

444
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:56,320
It's been a week.

445
00:27:59,120 --> 00:28:00,160
Hey Nont,

446
00:28:00,520 --> 00:28:01,560
if that's the case,

447
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:03,560
go check on the boss for me.

448
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:06,840
Nont,

449
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:09,480
don't be so heartless.

450
00:28:46,120 --> 00:28:47,440
If you don't care,

451
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:49,720
I'll just leave it and leave.

452
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,000
Kit.

453
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,000
Kit.

454
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:44,720
Kit.

455
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:48,520
Kit.

456
00:29:48,840 --> 00:29:49,880
Can you hear me?

457
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,320
Nont.

458
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,480
Is it really you, Nont?

459
00:29:57,320 --> 00:29:58,600
Yes. It's me.

460
00:30:00,040 --> 00:30:01,320
What's wrong with you?

461
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,560
Why are you like this?

462
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:25,600
You came back.

463
00:30:27,280 --> 00:30:28,600
I just came back for work.

464
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:31,600
Sharp said you haven't been

465
00:30:31,600 --> 00:30:32,840
to the office for days.

466
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:37,320
Tonight, can you stay with me?

467
00:30:48,760 --> 00:30:49,920
I was planning to come

468
00:30:50,280 --> 00:30:51,880
pick up the rest of my things.

469
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,600
Just one night.

470
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:10,920
Then you have to get up

471
00:31:10,920 --> 00:31:12,280
and take care of yourself first.

472
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:38,200
It's from your favorite shop

473
00:31:38,840 --> 00:31:39,880
near the office.

474
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,680
You still remember.

475
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:45,160
I remember everything.

476
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,000
Everything about you.

477
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,800
Thank you for coming back.

478
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:19,280
You're crying.

479
00:32:22,200 --> 00:32:23,840
I don't know what I'm feeling.

480
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:29,040
But it hurts right here.

481
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,400
It's hurt since the day you left.

482
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,320
I missed you.

483
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:46,920
I missed you too.

484
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:42,240
Go take a shower first.

485
00:33:44,040 --> 00:33:45,280
Can you help me shower?

486
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:17,080
What have I done?

487
00:34:17,800 --> 00:34:19,800
Why did I let fear hurt Nont,

488
00:34:20,640 --> 00:34:22,720
the only man I've ever felt good with?

489
00:34:39,120 --> 00:34:40,440
Kit, finish showering on your own.

490
00:34:42,080 --> 00:34:43,640
I'll go tidy up the room first.

491
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:58,960
I have tidied up the room.

492
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:03,640
There are also white roses,
the ones you like.

493
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:10,360
Nont.

494
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,720
Can you stay with me tonight?

495
00:36:25,560 --> 00:36:27,320
I know I don't have the right to ask.

496
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:31,640
I know my time is up.

497
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:43,880
Why do I have to go soft for you?

498
00:36:56,160 --> 00:36:57,240
If I stay,

499
00:36:59,120 --> 00:37:01,040
I want tonight to be a good memory.

500
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:09,080
I'll make tonight a good memory.

501
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:13,680
One we'll remember forever.

502
00:37:28,240 --> 00:37:31,800
♪ I've heard a thousand stories ♪

503
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:36,280
♪ But it never crossed my mind ♪

504
00:37:38,680 --> 00:37:43,560
♪ That my heart couldn't take a world
where you're not around ♪

505
00:37:49,480 --> 00:37:55,160
♪ Because I'm so sure that you're my one ♪

506
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:03,600
♪ I need you to know that ♪

507
00:38:03,760 --> 00:38:07,440
♪ After all the ups and downs
we've been through ♪

508
00:38:08,720 --> 00:38:12,360
♪ I know it with my heart, my soul and mind ♪

509
00:38:14,040 --> 00:38:18,200
♪ That through it all
I'll always be right with you ♪

510
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:22,440
♪ Know that I'm yours for life ♪

511
00:38:22,920 --> 00:38:24,240
Why are you crying?

512
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:30,360
Because this is the last time.

513
00:38:32,440 --> 00:38:35,800
♪ All my doubts and fear they disappear ♪

514
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:39,640
♪ Such a reassuring feeling ♪

515
00:38:40,080 --> 00:38:42,160
♪ That I know my heart is leading ♪

516
00:39:24,760 --> 00:39:26,360
Your heart is beating so fast.

517
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:30,120
It beats fast

518
00:39:31,680 --> 00:39:32,880
every time I'm near you.

519
00:39:47,080 --> 00:39:49,000
My heart beats fast because of you too.

520
00:40:11,720 --> 00:40:12,720
Kit.

521
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:15,160
Tonight, can you look at me?

522
00:40:16,400 --> 00:40:17,440
Look?

523
00:40:25,240 --> 00:40:26,400
Don't look away.

524
00:40:28,040 --> 00:40:29,320
Don't turn your face away.

525
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:36,000
I want you to remember me.

526
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:38,600
Remember everything.

527
00:40:39,680 --> 00:40:40,840
Remember the feeling.

528
00:40:41,680 --> 00:40:42,920
Remember that I belong to you.

529
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:48,080
Okay.

530
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,480
Tonight, you lead.

531
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:29,560
I don't know what to say.

532
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:33,960
You don't have to say anything.

533
00:41:36,760 --> 00:41:38,120
Just show me.

534
00:42:38,040 --> 00:42:39,080
Do you know,

535
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:41,000
you're the only one for me.

536
00:42:43,200 --> 00:42:44,720
You're the only one for me, too.

537
00:42:54,040 --> 00:42:55,160
I love you.

538
00:43:02,960 --> 00:43:03,960
Thank you.

539
00:43:05,440 --> 00:43:06,680
For letting me love you.

540
00:43:16,600 --> 00:43:17,640
Does it hurt?

541
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:22,920
No.

542
00:43:23,960 --> 00:43:25,000
I'm sorry.

543
00:45:12,520 --> 00:45:13,520
Nont.

544
00:45:16,760 --> 00:45:17,800
Yes?

545
00:45:24,480 --> 00:45:25,880
I have to admit...

546
00:45:30,560 --> 00:45:31,560
Admit what?

547
00:45:37,360 --> 00:45:38,760
I admit I'm afraid.

548
00:45:51,240 --> 00:45:52,240
Afraid of what?

549
00:45:57,280 --> 00:45:58,400
Afraid of everything.

550
00:46:01,280 --> 00:46:02,880
Afraid I'll change.

551
00:46:04,920 --> 00:46:06,600
Afraid of what others will think.

552
00:46:11,600 --> 00:46:12,840
Afraid of what Mom will think.

553
00:46:18,120 --> 00:46:19,600
But the thing I'm most afraid of...

554
00:46:22,240 --> 00:46:23,640
is losing you.

555
00:46:27,080 --> 00:46:28,760
Last time, when you left,

556
00:46:32,440 --> 00:46:33,600
I felt like my heart was

557
00:46:33,600 --> 00:46:34,760
going to stop beating.

558
00:46:39,000 --> 00:46:40,920
I don't want you to go anywhere anymore.

559
00:46:56,640 --> 00:46:57,680
Kit.

560
00:47:00,240 --> 00:47:01,440
Because you are afraid,

561
00:47:03,280 --> 00:47:04,800
that's exactly why I have to leave.

562
00:47:38,960 --> 00:47:40,720
Wellness isn't something far from us.

563
00:47:40,760 --> 00:47:42,520
It's a "lifestyle"
that everyone wants to have.

564
00:47:42,560 --> 00:47:44,200
It's something everyone must have.

565
00:47:45,640 --> 00:47:47,600
Nont, could you help rub my back for me?

566
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:49,120
Sure.

567
00:47:51,640 --> 00:47:52,680
Boss.

568
00:47:53,000 --> 00:47:54,200
Right now, in your mind,

569
00:47:54,600 --> 00:47:55,760
what is Nont to you?

570
00:47:55,800 --> 00:47:57,200
Stop lying to yourself first.

571
00:47:57,560 --> 00:47:58,840
Can you do that?

572
00:47:58,960 --> 00:48:00,440
Nont is someone I care about.

573
00:48:00,920 --> 00:48:03,240
I want Nont to be my boyfriend!

574
00:48:04,040 --> 00:48:06,400
That spot doesn't hurt.

575
00:48:06,520 --> 00:48:07,600
I know it doesn't hurt.

576
00:48:07,960 --> 00:48:09,240
But you feel it.

577
00:48:09,400 --> 00:48:11,600
Kit, you're not the masseur.

578
00:48:11,800 --> 00:48:14,400
But I know best
